{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "mrange",
  "description": "TS.MRANGE profile: the query fixture (1,000 series x 1,000 samples, labels at 1 %/10 %/100 % selectivity). Raw reads from 10 x 10 (per-command fixed cost) to 1,000 x 100 and 100 x 1,000 (100k samples per reply); `head100` against `recent100` separates decoding the samples a window discards; a WITHLABELS twin isolates label emission and a RESP3 twin the wire format; c1 cases measure a lone query (the subject defers standalone MRANGE off the main thread past a work threshold, so a lone small and a lone large read take different paths) against c8 under contention; per-series aggregation (avg, ~100 buckets) at 10 % and 100 %; GROUPBY/REDUCE over 10 groups at c1 and c8. Plan defaults: 5 trials, 5 s warm-up, 30 s reads.",
